UID:network:30g9s6703bhvace5266q24ejiq_R20260806T170000@google.com-2026-08
 -06T17:00:00.000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260725T134822Z
DTSTART:20260806T170000Z
DTEND:20260806T180000Z
SUMMARY:All-Campus Virtual OSPO Meetup
DESCRIPTION:UC Santa Barbara is hosting this month\, with a focus on how A
 I is changing open source workflows. We'll look at where AI tools are show
 ing up across the open source lifecycle—writing and reviewing code\, doc
 umentation\, maintenance\, and community work—and chat about what we fin
 d is actually useful\, where the friction is\, and what it means for maint
 ainers and researchers working in the open.\nWe'll have two guest speakers
 :\n- Rachel King\, NCEAS\, UC Santa Barbara\n- Carlo Broderick\, NCEAS\, U
 C Santa Barbara\n\nStudents\, staff\, faculty\, researchers\, and folks ou
 tside UC all welcome!\nRegister here: https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/985271824
 49?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQbYPGHOmGrb5o.1
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/98527182449?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQ
 bYPGHOmGrb5o.1
END:VEVENT
