SUMMARY:All-Campus Virtual OSPO Meetup
DESCRIPTION:A monthly gathering for the UC open source community. Each mee
 tup is co-hosted by a different campus in the network—the hosting campus
  sets the agenda for the first half (demos\, workshops\, guest speakers\, 
 whatever they want to share)\, and the second half is an open community ca
 ll for network updates\, project sharing\, and Q&A.\nStudents\, staff\, fa
 culty\, researchers\, and folks outside UC all welcome!\nRegister here: h
 ttps://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/98527182449?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQbYPGHOmGrb5o.1
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/98527182449?pwd=PMdoVaOTSYuAHqPVWQ
 bYPGHOmGrb5o.1
END:VEVENT
